{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>佳存UC-II啤酒花配方60粒裝（Caltrate UC-II Hops）邊度買平？新假期整理屈臣氏、萬寧、HKTVmall及龍豐共4間零售商的網店報價。以同款單盒標價計，最低與次低相差HK$109.8，約22%。</p>\n<h2>佳存UC-II啤酒花配方60粒裝各網店報價</h2>\n<table>\n<thead></thead>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th><strong>零售商</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒標價</strong></th>\n<th><strong>單盒總額</strong></th>\n<th><strong>計價條件</strong></th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>最低已核實｜龍豐</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$390</strong></td>\n<td><strong>HK$390</strong></td>\n<td><strong>單盒標價</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HKTVmall</td>\n<td>HK$499.8</td>\n<td>HK$499.8</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>萬寧</td>\n<td>HK$499.9</td>\n<td>HK$499.9</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>屈臣氏</td>\n<td>HK$499.9</td>\n<td>HK$499.9</td>\n<td>單盒標價</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>佳存UC-II啤酒花配方60粒裝單盒價錢點計？</h2>\n<p>買一盒佳存UC-II啤酒花配方60粒裝，龍豐的同款網上標價為HK$390，較表列次低標價HK$499.8少HK$109.8。佳存UC-II啤酒花配方60粒裝這個價差以單盒商品標價比較。若打算買多件，宜另計商戶的購買條件及結帳價。</p>\n<p>以上為2026年11月14日商戶網上報價，未計運費，價格、優惠及供應以商戶為準。網店來源：<a href=\"https://www.watsons.com.hk/zh-hk/%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98-%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98-uc-ii-%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92%E8%8A%B1%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9-60%E7%B2%92%E8%A3%9D/p/BP_821701\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">屈臣氏</a><a href=\"https://www.mannings.com.hk/zh-hant/caltrate-uc-ii-hops-60pcs/p/129858\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬寧</a><a href=\"https://www.hktvmall.com/hktv/zh/main/Haleon/s/H1139001/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E8%AD%B7%E7%90%86%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5/%E4%BF%9D%E5%81%A5%E7%94%A2%E5%93%81/%E9%AA%A8%E9%AA%BC-%E9%97%9C%E7%AF%80/%E4%BD%B3%E5%AD%98-UCII-%E5%95%A4%E9%85%92%E8%8A%B1%E9%85%8D%E6%96%B9-60%E7%89%87/p/H0888001_S_10162898\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">HKTVmall</a><a href=\"https://eshop.lungfung.hk/product/mdn250289/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">龍豐</a></p>\n<p>這款配方含非變性第二型膠原蛋白（UC-II）和啤酒花萃取物。第二型膠原蛋白是軟骨的結構成分；補充劑的效果不能單憑成分推斷。如對成分或服用有疑問，建議先諮詢醫生或其他合資格的醫護專業人士。<a href=\"https://www.caltrate.com.hk/joint-health/what-is-uc-2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">佳存香港：UC-II成分資料</a></p>\n<p>計算方法：（較高標價－較低標價）÷較高標價×100%。本次以（HK$499.8－HK$390）÷HK$499.8×100%計，約22%。上述比例未計運費及額外活動，亦不代表全港最低價、歷史低價或不同包裝版本的配方已完全核實一致。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463250459615672_20922669906af7eb39430da.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"佳存UC-II啤酒花配方60粒裝格價：龍豐 HK$390，單盒約平22%\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179463250459615672_20922669906af7eb39430da.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a></p>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>點樣先可以用圖中價格買到佳存UC-II啤酒花配方60粒裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>以2026年11月14日網上報價，龍豐的單盒商品總額為HK$390。條件為單盒標價，未計運費。</p>\n<p>今次格價比較哪一款包裝？<i></i></p>\n<p>比較的是啤酒花配方60粒裝，並非一般UC-II關節配方。</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T05:20:02.102416+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":809,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T05:01:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T07:14:55.962794+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T05:13:27.375804+00:00","content_hash":"978edaee78b66b26fefde3ce7b3ded8b6540ae744ca467f141a77d67db315e90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}